(PLAYSPHERE  ULTRA-COMPREHENSIVE MASTER ARCHITECTURE SPECIFICATION) '
(=================================================================================) '
(Platform: Grassroots Sports OS for India \(Telangana Focus\)) '
(Repository: PlaySphere \(Flutter Mobile/Web + Firebase + Node.js Cloud Functions\)) '
() '
(1. EXECUTIVE ARCHITECTURE PILLARS) '
(---------------------------------------------------------------------------------) '
(1. OFFLINE-FIRST EVENT SOURCING \(MUST\):) '
(   Scoring happens on grounds with zero cellular signal. All actions append to an) '
(   immutable MatchEvent log. Local device is the source of truth; sync is background.) '
() '
(2. DYNAMIC RULECONFIG ABSTRACTION \(MUST\):) '
(   No sport rules \(overs, set caps, point values, raid time\) are hardcoded.) '
(   Every scoring engine reads dynamic RuleConfig overrides per competition.) '
() '
(3. SINGLE AUTHORIZED SCORER LOCK INVARIANT:) '
(   To prevent write conflicts, each match has exactly one active scorer lock.) '
() '
(4. ZERO-TRUST SECURITY BOUNDARY \(firestore.rules\):) '
(   Client handles UI; server firestore.rules enforces append-only logs, role-based) '
(   authorization, and minor safety under the Indian DPDP Act.) '
() '
(5. SERVER-SIDE FINANCIAL & RATING LEDGERS \(Cloud Functions asia-south1\):) '
(   Glicko-2 ratings and official tournament ranking points are computed strictly) '
(   in Cloud Functions to eliminate client-side rank tampering.) '
() '
(2. SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE & LAYER BREAKDOWN) '
(---------------------------------------------------------------------------------) '
([PRESENTATION LAYER] Flutter 3.x / Material 3 / GoRouter v14.2.0) '
( - Declarative URLs: /home, /org/:id, /event/:id/score/:id, /watch/:id) '
( - Responsive Layouts: Touch targets >= 60pt on mobile, keyboard shortcuts on laptop) '
( - Localization: AppLocalizations \(Telugu, Hindi, English resource files\)) '
() '
([STATE MANAGEMENT LAYER] Riverpod v2.5.1) '
( - Providers: currentUserProvider, authStateProvider, fixtureProvider) '
() '
([DOMAIN & SPORT ENGINE LAYER] Pure Functional Dart Modules) '
( - Sport Engines: Cricket, Badminton, Football, Volleyball, Kabaddi, Kho-Kho) '
( - AI Team Balancer: Snake draft + rating differential minimizer) '
( - UNDO Engine: Reconstructs state from append-only MatchEvent log reversals) '
ET
endobj
