(3. COMPLETE SCREEN-BY-SCREEN COMPONENT INVENTORY) '
(=================================================================================) '
() '
(1. HomeScreen \(/home\)  Member Launchpad) '
(   - _HomeHeader: Welcome banner, profile avatar, search bar) '
(   - _MyClubsSection: Carousel of joined clubs with role badges \(Owner, Admin, Scorer\)) '
(   - _LiveMatchesBar: Active live matches across user's clubs with real-time score tickers) '
(   - _QuickActionGrid: 1-tap shortcuts to Quick Match, Looking For Board, Officials) '
() '
(2. OrgHomeScreen \(/org/:orgId\)  Club Dashboard) '
(   - _ClubHeader: Logo, banner, location tag \(Mandal/District\), total members count) '
(   - _ClubFeed: Announcements list, poll widgets, recent memory media grid) '
(   - _UpcomingEventsSection: Event cards with 1-tap RSVP buttons \(Going, Maybe, No\)) '
(   - _InterClubChallengesCard: Incoming challenges with Accept/Decline actions) '
() '
(3. QuickMatchScreen \(/org/:orgId/quick-match\)  Casual Match Setup) '
(   - DropdownButtonFormField: Sport selector \(Cricket, Badminton, Kabaddi, etc.\)) '
(   - ChoiceChip Row: Side format selector \(Singles, Doubles, 6-a-side, 11-a-side\)) '
(   - _RulesetCard: Expandable preset selector \(T20, 8-over Gully\) with editable rules) '
(   - _SideCard: Side A & Side B roster list with 1-tap member toggles) '
(   - _AutoBalanceButton: 1-tap AI Team Auto-Balance trigger using Glicko-2 ratings) '
(   - OutlinedButton \('Add by code'\): Add players from other clubs via PSOS code) '
(   - FilledButton \('Start match & score'\): Creates fixture and opens ScoringScreen) '
() '
(4. ScoringScreen \(/org/:orgId/event/:compId/score/:fixtureId\)  Scoring Pad) '
(   - _Scoreboard: High-contrast scoreboard card \(teams, headline score, summary\)) '
(   - _PendingBanner: Offline queue badge showing pending actions waiting to upload) '
(   - FilledButton.tonalIcon \('Undo last'\): Always-visible 1-tap UNDO button) '
(   - _ControlRow: Dynamic action buttons \([0],[1],[2],[4],[6],[Wd],[Nb],[Wicket]\)) '
(   - MatchScorecard: Full box score tables \(BattingLine, BowlingLine, FallOfWicket\)) '
(   - MatchMemoriesSection: In-match photo/video clip uploader and thumbnail grid) '
(   - _AdminActions: Outcome overrides for walkover, retirement, disqualification) '
ET
endobj
