(4. PUBLIC VIEWS, PROFILES & GOVERNMENT DASHBOARD) '
(=================================================================================) '
() '
(5. SpectatorScreen \(/org/:orgId/event/:compId/watch/:fixtureId\)  Public Live View) '
(   - _LiveHeader: Real-time score ticker backed by Firestore snapshot listener) '
(   - _WagonWheelWidget: Interactive graphic showing shot angles and distances) '
(   - _BallByBallFeed: Chronological commentary timeline with event icons) '
() '
(6. CareerProfileScreen \(/player/:uid\)  Portable Lifelong Player Identity) '
(   - _ProfileHeader: Photo, verification tier \(Self, Scorer Verified, Association\)) '
(   - _CrossSportIndexCard: Overall 'Sports OS Index' score \(0100\)) '
(   - _RatingHistoryChart: Line chart tracking Glicko-2 rating progression) '
() '
(7. AnalyticsScreen \(/org/:orgId/analytics\)  B2G Government Dashboard) '
(   - _FilterHeader: Location picker \(State -> District -> Mandal -> Village\)) '
(   - _KpiMetricGrid: Active participants, match count, venue utilization %, para ratio) '
() '
(5. DATABASE SCHEMAS & ENTITY RELATIONSHIP MODEL) '
(---------------------------------------------------------------------------------) '
(ENTITIES TABLE:) '
(- users: uid \(PK\), phone, name, dateOfBirth, profileVisibility, verificationTier, district) '
(- orgs: id \(PK\), name, type \(community|school|college|village\), location, inviteCode) '
(- memberships: uid \(PK\), orgId \(FK\), role \(owner|admin|scorer|member\), status) '
(- competitions: id \(PK\), orgId \(FK\), sportId, format, status, ruleConfig) '
(- fixtures: id \(PK\), competitionId \(FK\), entrantAId, entrantBId, scorerUid, scoreState) '
(- match_events: docId \(000001 PK\), fixtureId \(FK\), seq, type, payload, clientEventId) '
(- tournaments: id \(PK\), orgId \(FK\), grade \(club|district|state|national\), status) '
(- ranking_entries: id \(PK\), uid \(FK\), tournamentId \(FK\), points, round, awardedAt) '
(- ratings: sportId \(PK\), uid \(FK\), rating \(r\), deviation \(RD\), volatility, settledFixtures) '
ET
endobj
