(6. END-TO-END EVENT FLOWS & 5G RECONCILIATION) '
(=================================================================================) '
() '
(FLOW A: OFFLINE MATCH SCORING LIFECYCLE) '
(1. Scorer Action: Tap action button \([4], [Wicket]\) on ScoringScreen.) '
(2. Pure Validation: SportEngine.validate\(\) checks rules against RuleConfig.) '
(3. Local Render \(<100ms\): State updates locally; event enqueued to SharedPreferences.) '
(4. UI Badge: Shows 'X actions waiting to sync' banner.) '
(5. 5G Reconnect: ScoringService.reconcileQueue\(\) flushes batch to Cloud Firestore.) '
(6. Triggers Fire: Glicko-2 ratings update + Multicast FCM push sent to club members.) '
() '
(FLOW B: 5G RECONCILIATION & QUEUE SAFEGUARDS) '
([Offline Ground Scoring] ␀␀> [Write UUIDv7 to Queue] ␀␀> [Instant Local Render]) '
(                                                                ) '
(                                                     \(5G Connection Hits\)) '
(                                                                ) '
(                                                                ¼) '
([Firestore SDK Flush] ␀␀> [SyncBatchPlanner.plan\(\)] ␀␀> [Cap Batch at 500 Events]) '
(                                                                ) '
(                                                                ¼) '
([Monotonic Seq & Lock Check] ␀␀> [Atomic Server Commit] ␀␀> [Clear Pending Badge]) '
(                                                                ) '
(                                                                ¼) '
([Cloud Functions Trigger: Glicko-2 Ratings + Multicast FCM Push + Spectator Push]) '
() '
(7. CRITICAL PROTECTIONS ON RECONNECT:) '
(- Idempotency: Every event docId is sequence padded string \(events/000042\). No duplicate balls.) '
(- Causal Order: Events replayed strictly in seq order \(1 -> 2 -> 3\).) '
(- 500-Event Cap: Multi-day offline tournaments flush in 500-event steady passes.) '
ET
